velope, idempotency, pagination, invocation gateway, telemetry ingestion, and billing/webhook contracts."}]}],"id":"blk-49836","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-49838","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49840","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76745","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement runtime portability"}]}],"id":"blk-49839","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-49841","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49843","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76746","marks":["code"],"text":"20_RUNTIME_PROVIDER_INTERFACE.md"},{"id":"spn-76747","text":" — Runtime Provider Interface (RPI) that all runtimes must implement, plus adapter guidance (including AgentCore TypeScript adapter guidance using "},{"id":"spn-76748","marks":["code"],"text":"@aws-sdk/client-bedrock-agentcore"},{"id":"spn-76749","text":", and notes on the "},{"id":"spn-76750","marks":["code"],"text":"bedrock-agentcore"},{"id":"spn-76751","text":" tools SDK ecosystem)."}]}],"id":"blk-49842","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-49844","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49846","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76752","marks":["bold"],"text":"Build your control-plane data layer"}]}],"id":"blk-49845","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-49847","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49849","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76753","marks":["code"],"text":"30_DATA_MODEL_SUPABASE.md"},{"id":"spn-76754","text":" — Supabase/PostgreSQL schema, indexes, invariants, RLS policies, retention and deletion semantics."}]}],"id":"blk-49848","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-49850","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49852","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76755","marks":["bold"],"text":"Lock down security and secrets"}]}],"id":"blk-49851","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":5},{"id":"blk-49853","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49855","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76756","marks":["code"],"text":"40_SECURITY_SECRETS_COMPLIANCE.md"},{"id":"spn-76757","text":" — threat model, secrets strategy requirements, telemetry integrity, webhook integrity, artifact safety, acceptance criteria."}]}],"id":"blk-49854","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-49856","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49858","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76758","marks":["bold"],"text":"Build metering, billing UX, and enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-49857","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":6},{"id":"blk-49859","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49861","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76759","marks":["code"],"text":"50_OBSERVABILITY_BILLING_LIMITS.md"},{"id":"spn-76760","text":" — telemetry pipeline, aggregation model, cost estimation (estimated in v1), tier entitlements, runtime gating, limit enforcement algorithms."}]}],"id":"blk-49860","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-49862","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49864","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76761","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify correctness end-to-end"}]}],"id":"blk-49863","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":7},{"id":"blk-49865","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49867","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76762","marks":["code"],"text":"60_TESTING_ACCEPTANCE.md"},{"id":"spn-76763","text":" — unit/integration/E2E test plan + release gates and system-level definition of done."}]}],"id":"blk-49866","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-49868","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-76764","text":"Architecture Decision Records (ADRs)"}]},{"id":"blk-49869","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76765","text":"ADRs document the “why” behind major choices and define additional constraints that implementations must satisfy."}]},{"id":"blk-49870","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-49872","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-76766","marks":["code"],"text":"adr/ADR-0001-multi-r